This product includes software originally architected, designed, and developed
by Sagar Biswas (MultiHAT), including:
- Offline-first AES-256 local encryption and key derivation architecture
- Built-in AI Librarian evaluation and multi-provider routing engine (Gemini & Groq fallback)
- Dynamic {{variable}} template parsing and execution engine
- Supabase cloud synchronization, analytics, and instant command-palette (Cmd/Ctrl+K) search

